            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher dieser ist der Gleichheitsoperator?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du möchtest prüfen, ob <code>color</code> den Wert <code>\"red\"</code> speichert. Welcher Operator gehört in den Vergleich?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>!=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 76778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird in der Konsole angezeigt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LED+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;LED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>False</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die angezeigte Ausgabe gehört zu <code>\"LED+\" == \"LED\"</code>.</p><p>Was zeigt der Code an, wenn du den rechten String in <code>\"LED+\"</code> änderst?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LED+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;LED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"LED+\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>True</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 76777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche dieser Vergleiche ergibt <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Vergleich mit <code>==</code> soll <code>True</code> ergeben. Welcher davon tut das?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" = \"apple\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 76790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob <code>my_answer</code> gleich <code>solution</code> ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution  = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Wörter <code>\"act\"</code> und <code>\"ace\"</code> sind fast gleich, aber nicht gleich.</p><p>Vergleiche <code>my_answer</code> mit <code>solution</code>, damit der Code <code>False</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution  = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 76776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere den String <code>\"high\"</code> in <code>my_answer</code>, sodass der Vergleich <code>False</code> ergibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"high\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Vergleich ist nur <code>False</code>, wenn die zwei Strings nicht gleich sind.</p><p>Speichere <code>\"high\"</code> in <code>my_answer</code> und vergleiche es, damit der Code <code>False</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"high\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>==</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 76774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen String in <code>item_2</code>, um das Ergebnis des Vergleichs <code>False</code> zu machen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"item_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_duplicate = item_1 == item_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"pipe\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>is_duplicate</code> wird nur <code>True</code>, wenn beide Elemente exakt derselbe String sind.</p><p>Speichere einen anderen String in <code>item_2</code>. Prüfe, ob die Elemente gleich sind, sodass <code>is_duplicate</code> <code>False</code> ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"item_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_duplicate = item_1 == item_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pipe\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"pipe\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>==</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
