            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob <code>\"liquid\"</code> gleich <code>\"solid\"</code> ist, indem du <code>==</code> codierst.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;liquid&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;solid&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>==</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
